### Batur API — koleksi endpoint (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Jalankan server dulu: npm start

@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@device = demo-device

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

###

### List semua skill
GET {{base}}/skills

###

### List skill aktif kategori waktu
GET {{base}}/skills?category=waktu&active=true

###

### Definisi tool untuk model AI
GET {{base}}/skills/tools

###

### Detail skill set-alarm
GET {{base}}/skills/set-alarm

###

### Toggle skill: nonaktifkan
PATCH {{base}}/skills/set-alarm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "is_active": false }

###

### Toggle skill: aktifkan kembali
PATCH {{base}}/skills/set-alarm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "is_active": true }

###

### List model
GET {{base}}/models

###

### Detail model
GET {{base}}/models/cloud-gateway

###

### Proses perintah alarm (fallback parser)
POST {{base}}/agent/cloud
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "Bangunin aku jam 5 subuh",
  "device_id": "{{device}}"
}

###

### Proses perintah timer
POST {{base}}/agent/cloud
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "Set timer 25 menit",
  "device_id": "{{device}}"
}

###

### Proses perintah catatan
POST {{base}}/agent/cloud
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "Catat: beli susu dan telur besok",
  "device_id": "{{device}}"
}

###

### Proses perintah WhatsApp
POST {{base}}/agent/cloud
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "wa ke 081234567890 bilang Halo, aku sudah sampai",
  "device_id": "{{device}}"
}

###

### Proses perintah maps
POST {{base}}/agent/cloud
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "Navigasi ke Universitas Diponegoro Semarang",
  "device_id": "{{device}}"
}

###

### Simpan tugas contoh
POST {{base}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "{{device}}",
  "command": "Pasang alarm jam 6 pagi",
  "mode": "cloud",
  "skill_slug": "set-alarm",
  "status": "success",
  "result_text": "Alarm 06.00 berhasil dipasang.",
  "latency_ms": 320,
  "steps": [
    { "type": "input",        "content": "Pasang alarm jam 6 pagi" },
    { "type": "tool_call",    "content": "set_alarm(hour=6, minute=0)" },
    { "type": "confirmation", "content": "Pengguna menyetujui" },
    { "type": "execution",    "content": "AlarmClock.ACTION_SET_ALARM" },
    { "type": "response",     "content": "Alarm 06.00 berhasil dipasang." }
  ]
}

###

### List riwayat
GET {{base}}/tasks?device_id={{device}}

###

### Statistik tugas
GET {{base}}/tasks/stats?device_id={{device}}

###

### Detail tugas (ganti 1 dengan id nyata)
GET {{base}}/tasks/1

###

### Hapus tugas (ganti 1 dengan id nyata)
DELETE {{base}}/tasks/1

###

### Simpan catatan
POST {{base}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_id": "{{device}}",
  "content": "Beli susu dan telur besok"
}

###

### List catatan
GET {{base}}/notes?device_id={{device}}

###

### Hapus catatan (ganti 1 dengan id nyata)
DELETE {{base}}/notes/1
